<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold;">**Answer Key:**</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> 1. hij 2. zij 3. het 4. het</span></span>
